flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"399\">De Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra is Samsungs vlaggenschip en biedt topprestaties voor fotografie, gaming, werk en dagelijks gebruik. Dankzij de krachtige Snapdragon-processor, het schitterende AMOLED-scherm en de geavanceerde camera's maak je indrukwekkende foto's en video's. Het krasvrije scherm zorgt ervoor dat het toestel er zeer netjes uitziet.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"445\"><strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"410\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"413\">In Nette Staat<br data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"430\">Krasvrij scherm</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"650\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"462\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"465\">⭐ Krasvrij scherm<br data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"485\">⭐ Krachtige Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 processor<br data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"528\">⭐ Premium titanium behuizing<br data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"559\">⭐ Geavanceerd camerasysteem met telelenzen<br data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"604\">⭐ Ingebouwde S Pen voor extra productiviteit</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"1146\">📋 <strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"672\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"675\"><strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"686\">Opslag:</strong> 256GB<br data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"695\"><strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"703\">RAM:</strong> 12GB<br data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"711\"><strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"722\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Scherm:</strong> 6.8 inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X, 3120 × 1440, 120Hz<br data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"772\"><strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"786\">Processor:</strong> Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 for Galaxy, Octa-core tot 3.39 GHz<br data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"852\"><strong data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"865\">Camera's:</strong> 200MP hoofdcamera + 50MP periscoop telelens + 10MP telelens + 12MP ultragroothoek, 12MP frontcamera<br data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"968\"><strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"987\">Connectiviteit:</strong> 5G, WiFi 7, Bluetooth 5.3, NFC, USB-C<br data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1028\"><strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1050\">Besturingssysteem:</strong> Android<br data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1061\"><strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1071\">Extra:</strong> Ingebouwde S Pen<br data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1091\"><strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1101\">Kleur:</strong> Titanium Black<br data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1119\"><strong data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1129\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1205\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1166\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1169\">Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra<br data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1196\">Oplader</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1266\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1229\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1232\">Incl. Garantie: 3 maanden garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
